  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Sister K (Circle K Clerk)
    Text: 'Still on the clock? It feels like your shift started a century ago.

'
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Money doesn't sleep, Sis. Just trying to finish the list before my bike
      decides to quit.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Sister K (Circle K Clerk)
    Text: "I hear you. My shift is dragging too. We\u2019re both just running in
      circles today, aren't we?"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Pretty much. At least one of us has a roof over their head while doing
      it.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Sister K (Circle K Clerk)
    Text: Hehe, fair point! Go on, don't let me keep you from your "millions."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
